{"ID":"20240504161425-um33ujb","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161425-um33ujb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161425-um33ujb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161425-eebzp2y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617090811-eyyqyn6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161425-eebzp2y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"089别羁","updated":"20240620125600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504161425-eebzp2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504161425-eebzp2y","updated":"20240620125600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240607135311-190d8ha","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135311-190d8ha"}},{"ID":"20240607135313-aa5yc23","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135313-aa5yc23","updated":"20240607135318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135313-6hgyt1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135313-6hgyt1n","updated":"20240607135313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135313-5j8nk9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135313-5j8nk9c","updated":"20240607135313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风寒湿痹，身重，四肢疼酸，寒邪，历节痛。生川谷（旧在《唐本草》中无毒，今增）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135313-6md3ijk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135313-6md3ijk","updated":"20240607135313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名别枝，一名别骑，一名鳖羁，生蓝田，二月八月采；案陶宏景云：方家时有用处，今俗亦绝耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135313-3x0wyfq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135313-3x0wyfq"}},{"ID":"20240607135334-l6oq1ui","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135334-l6oq1ui","updated":"20240607135339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135334-wfednyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135334-wfednyg","updated":"20240607135334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．一名别枝，一名别骑，一名鳖羁．生蓝田．二月、八月采．"}]},{"ID":"20240607135334-h267s1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135334-h267s1x","updated":"20240607135334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶别羁，味苦，微温．主风寒湿痹身重，四肢疼酸，寒邪历节痛．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240607135335-mjki92a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135335-mjki92a"}},{"ID":"20240607135336-zzs94tz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135336-zzs94tz","updated":"20240617090343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240617090305-65bquwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090305-65bquwi","updated":"20240617090336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微温，无毒。主风寒湿痹，身重，四肢疼酸，寒邪历节痛。一名别枝，一名别骑，一名鳖羁。生蓝田川谷，二月八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090336-pgvk03s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617090336-pgvk03s"}},{"ID":"20240617090510-zoyf11s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617090510-zoyf11s","updated":"20240617090528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617090510-ei44cah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090510-ei44cah","updated":"20240620125524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微温，无毒。主风寒湿痹，身重，四肢疼酸，寒邪厉节痛。一名别枝，一名别骑，一名鳖羁 。生蓝田川谷。二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090510-qclq2bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090510-qclq2bc","updated":"20240617090510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方∶家时有用处，今俗亦绝尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090511-5r24e1s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617090511-5r24e1s"}},{"ID":"20240617090722-qgc3w4h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617090722-qgc3w4h","updated":"20240617090744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617090722-dov9mec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090722-dov9mec","updated":"20240617090736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微温，无毒。主风寒，湿痹，身重，四肢疼酸，寒邪历节痛。一名别枝，一名别骑，一名鳖羁。生兰田川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090722-u9e4guz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090722-u9e4guz","updated":"20240617090722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090722-5s842b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090722-5s842b8","updated":"20240617090722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方家时有用处，今俗亦绝耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090722-6xar5j6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617090722-6xar5j6"}},{"ID":"20240617090809-5pdhuk9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617090809-5pdhuk9","updated":"20240617090815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别羁《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240617090809-h7rei9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090809-h7rei9s","updated":"20240617090809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微温。主风寒湿痹。身重四肢疼酸。寒邪历节痛。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090809-evz79e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090809-evz79e6","updated":"20240617090809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝田玉暖。小燠别枝。身重。酸痹愁羁。融通百节。安畅全肢。青逵春日。凉吹秋期。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090809-0qnb3fz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090809-0qnb3fz","updated":"20240617090809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（鲁猥切。呼最切。）李商隐诗。蓝田日暖玉生烟。晋书志。小燠不书。名医曰。一名别枝。广韵。肿大也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090809-ovjslec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090809-ovjslec","updated":"20240617090809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"博雅。酸痛也。任行状。表里融通。苏轼诗。遇境即安畅。名医曰。二月八日采。刘臻妻颂。青逵升震。唐太宗诗。凉吹肃离宫。"}]},{"ID":"20240617090810-br7i532","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617090810-br7i532"}},{"ID":"20240617090811-eyyqyn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617090811-eyyqyn6"}}]}